---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Status"
  description="Operational status of the Trackwise platform."
  eyebrow="Status"
>
  <p>
    A public, third-party status page is on our roadmap. Until it is live,
    operational notices are communicated to onboarded customers by email and
    in-app message.
  </p>

  <h2>Subscribe to incident notifications</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:status@trackwise.finance">status@trackwise.finance</a>{' '}
    to be added to the incident notification list once it is operational.
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting an incident</h2>
  <p>
    If you are an onboarded customer and believe you are experiencing an
    incident, contact your customer-success representative or email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:support@trackwise.finance">support@trackwise.finance</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
